# Reactive Surface Water HTML Similarity Report - 2026-07-06

## Scope

- Compares `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Water/RT_RS_Water` normal output against `wave_ripple_no_rain.html` formula.
- Uses deterministic mousedown/drag/settle input and the Material/RT water path.
- The Unreal step material reads height RTs with integer `Texture2D.Load` samples to match the HTML cell-grid solver.
- Source positions are snapped to the RT cell grid to match the HTML `Math.round()` mouse coordinate contract.
- Height ping-pong RTs use `RTF_RGBA32F`; the public normal RT remains `RTF_RGBA16F`.
- Runtime default `RS_Water_HeightEncodeScale` is `0.10`; this improves RT feedback precision without changing the wave equation.

